  "body": "Set in a highly sought-after location and proudly positioned within the Rangitoto College zone, this brand-new four-bedroom home offers an exciting opportunity for families seeking quality, convenience and modern living.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed with contemporary style and everyday functionality in mind, the home features four spacious bedrooms, including a generous master bedroom, complemented by quality finishes and beautifully appointed living spaces.\r\n\r\nLocation is another standout. With a 24-hour gym, Petstock, McDonald's, Bear Park, Farro Fresh, supermarkets, restaurants and cafés all nearby, everyday essentials are right at your fingertips. Excellent public transport options, including the nearby bus terminal, further enhance the convenience.\r\n\r\nFor families, the Rangitoto College zone is a significant drawcard, complemented by a strong selection of nearby schooling options including Murrays Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Westlake Girls High School.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for your first home, upgrading for more space or seeking a smart addition to your property portfolio, this brand-new home deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nAn exceptional opportunity to secure modern family living in a location that truly delivers.",
